\description{
Era-correct team identity for a men's college basketball program in a
specific season, plus the available \verb{$ref} URLs for deeper resources
(record, statistics, leaders, athletes/roster, coaches, college, etc.).
Backed by the core-v2 endpoint
\code{sports.core.api.espn.com/v2/sports/basketball/leagues/mens-college-basketball/seasons/{season}/teams/{team_id}}.

Historical depth goes back to \strong{1939} at ESPN. Older seasons return
fewer \verb{$ref} keys; missing refs become \code{NA}.

Era-correct team identity for an NBA franchise in a specific season,
plus the available \verb{$ref} URLs for deeper resources (record, statistics,
leaders, coaches, etc.). Backed by the core-v2 endpoint
\code{sports.core.api.espn.com/v2/sports/basketball/leagues/nba/seasons/{season}/teams/{team_id}}.

Historical depth goes back to \strong{1947} (NBA founding). Older seasons
return fewer \verb{$ref} keys; missing refs become \code{NA}.
}
